            "text": "• The board reads the sensor at a fixed rate: the sampling rate, in samples per second (Hz)\n• Too slow and fast movements are missed; too fast and the board drowns in data\n• Every reading carries a little noise from the electronics\n• Averaging a few readings in a row smooths the noise — and delays the signal a little",
